WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.980
Oberammergau is a village in Bavaria.

2
00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:05.950
Every ten years, its
people stage the suffering,

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.520
death and resurrection of Jesus.

4
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:13.220
In 2022, about 1,800 villagers took part.

5
00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:16.270
They first performed it in 1634.

6
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:21.000
So why would a whole village act out a
man's death every ten years for nearly

7
00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.670
four centuries?

8
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.090
In this mission, you'll go from a Passion
performed across a Welsh town to nativity

9
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.630
plays, stages and screens.

10
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:33.700
Then you'll weigh up whether drama is the
best way to share the Christian message

11
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:34.740
today.

12
00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:39.890
Your mission: find out why Christians
turn the story of their faith into drama.
